  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rdz7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rdz7) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 151.4 depth occurred on Oct 01 2025 197 km NE of Lospalos, Timor Leste. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -7.349 longitude 128.3474. It impacted 3940 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
